From: Stained Glass OS <dev@stained-glass.example>
Subject: wofutil: implement WofSetFileDataLocation

Microsoft Edge's installer stores what it installs compressed through the
Windows Overlay Filter, and called this unimplemented export: its setup
crashed after unpacking, and Edge was never installed. Ask the file system,
as Windows does, with FSCTL_SET_EXTERNAL_BACKING on the handle; a file system
without an overlay filter refuses and the file stays as it is, which callers
treat as "not here". Adds the public WOF structures to wofapi.h.

--- a/include/wofapi.h
+++ b/include/wofapi.h
@@ -16,4 +16,36 @@
  * Foundation, Inc., 51 Franklin St, Fifth Floor, Boston, MA 02110-1301, USA
  */
 
